Cell["\<\
pathData is {samples, vertexMarkers}, as returned by PathSample. labels is a \
nonempty list of strings or OverBar expressions.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1423286793,ExpressionUUID->"af5e520a-8a3b-d142-8d71-328193a730a2"],

Cell["\<\
With one label per marker except the terminal marker, only the actual initial \
and internal vertices are labelled. With one label per marker, the terminal \
label is placed on the last available sample, one index before the omitted \
terminal vertex.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1532086968,ExpressionUUID->"acf84127-76c2-e247-86bd-0d1b5c0b9d7f"],

Cell["\<\
Additional arguments and Callout options are forwarded to each callout. \
Appearance -> \"CurvedLeader\" is supplied by the implementation.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1229783289,ExpressionUUID->"032fd557-331e-764c-9e03-e43edde713a3"],

Cell["\<\
The result is the sample list with selected elements wrapped in Callout, \
ready for plotting.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1942526853,ExpressionUUID->"e9695681-4ebb-8a42-9ef0-e6e9f0367b3b"]
}, Closed]],

